# @name createBill
POST http://localhost:3000/api/bills
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantWallet": "https://ilp.interledger-test.dev/camilo",
  "total": 120000,
  "participantes": [
    { "nombre": "Ana", "monto": 40000 },
    { "nombre": "Luis", "monto": 40000 },
    { "nombre": "Sofi", "monto": 40000 }
  ]
}

### Obtener cuenta
GET http://localhost:3000/api/bills/{{createBill.response.body.$.billId}}

### Iniciar pago
# @name iniciarPago
POST http://localhost:3000/api/bills/{{createBill.response.body.$.billId}}/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participanteId": "{{createBill.response.body.$.participantes[2].id}}",
  "walletAddress": "https://ilp.interledger-test.dev/camilo"
}

### Cerrar la cuenta y emitir el recibo (400 si todavía va en menos del 100%)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/bills/{{createBill.response.body.$.billId}}/complete
